data · tier 1 · 8 of 59 functions in this release

  frame       Create a frame from named lists of values
  import      Read a data file into a frame
  n_rows      Number of rows
  n_cols      Number of variables
  variables   List of variable names
  describe    Type, non-missing and missing count of each variable
  mean        Mean of a variable
  sd          Sample standard deviation

the rest arrive with later releases; `zeff help <name>` says when
